---LINES

mainv   = gh    -       -       -       -     "main view"
mainvk  = gv    -       -       -       -     "main view keys:"

cmded   = gh    -       -       -       -     "command editor"
cmdedk  = gv    -       -       -       -     "command editor keys:"

exit    = gh    -       -       -       -     "exit code indicator"
exitk   = gv    -       -       -       -     "exit code indicator keys:"

hist    = gh    -       -       -       -     "history view"
histk   = gv    -       -       -       -     "history view keys:"

runcmd  = gv    -       -       -       -     "//_run_a_command_//.........."
m       = gm    -       -       -       -     "*)"


---SCREEN
=vash workflow diagram
 .m. see 'man vash' for details        
                                       .mainvk.................................
     .'lowercase letters or '.' or '/': - type unix command from scratch  {1}
     .'uppercase, digit, and other key: - edit a command from template    {2} 
                                        - run instant command macro       {3} 
 .mainv.............................                                              
 ^  ^               .'[a-z./] |        .cmdedk.................................
 |  |   .m.             |     |        .:NL... - run a command                  
 |  |   .hist.........  | .'[A-Z0-9]   .:HE... - search in history view         
 |  |      ^   .:NL...  |   |   |      .:HE... - search in history view 
 | .:CA... |     |     {1}  |   |      .:CA... - switch between main view and 
 |  |      |     |      |  {2}  |           command editor, keeping both states
 |  |      |     |      |   |  {3}          command editor, keeping both states
 |  v    .:HE..  |      |   |   |      .histk..................................
 |  .cmded....................  |      .:NL... - get a command to editor    .m.
 |          ^         .:NL...   |                                              
 |          |           |       |      .exitk..................................
 .:SP...    |   .runcmd.............   .:SP..., .:CA... - return to main view  
 .:CA...   .m.          |               any key - return to command editor  .m.
 .exit..............................   
 .:NL... -->                           .:NL... - defencive trap for mistakes
---END
=vash, visual assistant for shell (C) 1990-1993,2018-2022 vsv
 may be vary, depending of profile in use 

